# Kodi with CB1 / DVBridge native Dolby Vision for CachyOS, built for direct KMS output (GBM/GLES).
# Source of truth: CroqueMr/libreelec-x86-dv, packages/mediacenter/kodi (patches and CB1 by CroqueMr).
# CMake options mirror LibreELEC's recorded Generic configure line; differences are commented.
# Everything lives under /opt/cb1 (rpath), so it coexists with Arch's kodi and system FFmpeg.
